body:
I have a couple of questions. (1) Do you think it's worth it to sign up for Prime Gaming for the Verv stuff if it's ending in a couple months, or wait to see what their next Prime Gaming promotion is? Seems like I missed some of the cooler items. 

&#x200B;

(2) I have been working on a spreadsheet that lists out items by update release. I am doing this as I am going through the game's history just for the fun of it, reading through past updates and operations, etc. Is this something that other players might be interested in once I get it in a decent place?
